# ── NEVER COMMIT ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 🚨 Git history is permanent. Anything committed and deleted later is still
# recoverable, and this repository is PUBLIC. The only real remedies after the
# fact are rewriting history or, for a credential, rotating it.

# Copyrighted game data. The ROM is Nintendo's. Save states are RAM dumps of
# that same copyrighted work, so they go too. Contributors supply their own ROM
# and take init.state from the upstream project — see README.
*.gb
*.gbc
*.sav
*.state
*.state.*

# Credentials. This client reads its token from the environment, never a file
# in the tree, so nothing here should ever exist — these are a backstop.
.env
.env.*
*token*.json
*tokens*
*cookies*
*.key
*.pem

# ── Local artifacts ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Checkpoints are ~14 MB each and are the server's to distribute, not ours.
*.zip
candidates/
runs/
runs_meta/
sessions/
eval_results.json
contrib_evals.json
frames/
*.mp4

venv/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
